usage: module-nav ui [-h] {dialogs,sizes,colors,fonts,class,customizable} ...

positional arguments:
  {dialogs,sizes,colors,fonts,class,customizable}
                        UI sub-commands
    dialogs             List all dialog classes
    sizes               List all hardcoded dimensions
    colors              List all hardcoded colors
    fonts               List all hardcoded fonts
    class               Full UI details for a specific class
    customizable        Summary of all patcheable UI elements

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
